1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,500
We filmed this sidewalk at Robertson Hall.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:14,400
Curb helps campus facilities teams decide
which access issues to inspect and which repairs to fund.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,400
Here’s the surface breaking up near Robertson Hall.

4
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:23,800
Click the finding and Curb jumps straight
to the frame behind it.

5
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:28,000
We prepared five AI-assisted findings from this clip.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,600
The reviewer can check each one against the video
and see what still needs a site measurement,

7
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:37,200
including the height difference and clear path width.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,500
Now suppose facilities has five hundred dollars.

9
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:48,600
Curb compares possible treatments and shows
what it would fund first.

10
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:54,500
Switch to the budget plan and you can see
the proposed work,

11
00:00:54,500 --> 00:01:00,700
the areas that would have to wait,
and the costs that still need quotes.

12
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:07,200
That gives the team a starting point
for deciding where to spend the money.

13
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:15,700
Finally, we export the plan so a facilities team
can take it to the site.

14
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:24,800
The report keeps the evidence, the proposed work,
and the open measurements and quotes together.

15
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:33,600
They can use it to walk the site,
get prices, and decide what to approve.
